Provenance and attribution
--------------------------
AstraForge is a 3D asset studio created by Artem Doronin (Dops Media). This `linux-support`
branch is an independent, clean-room re-implementation by Dmitry Belozerov (jimOnAir) of the
*behavior documented in* AstraForge Windows releases, produced under the protocol in
`docs/adr/0004-protocol-v2-clean-room-and-attribution.md`. It is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or a work of Dops Media; no rights in the AstraForge name or product are granted here.
This branch distributes no source code that is under the PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 or the
AstraForge Subscription license; the Windows releases remain distributed under those licenses.
The code below is original to this re-implementation and carries the MIT license that follows.

